<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts QSP cover.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts QSP cover.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quality Software Products Plc was rated &quot;trading buy&quot; at Goldman Sachs as the investment bank started coverage of the stock, Goldman said on Monday.</p>
<p>The stock was up 2-1/2p at 215 by 1240 GMT.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
